<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugo M1 money supply falls in Feb from Jan.</title>
<headline>Yugo M1 money supply falls in Feb from Jan.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Yugoslavia reported the following economic indicator details. YUGOSLAV MONEY SUPPLY (in billions of dinars)</p>
<p>				 FEB 97	JAN 97	FEB 96</p>
<p> M1			     5.157	 5.234	 3.237</p>
<p> M2			     7.044	 7.156	 4.348</p>
<p> M3			    32.054	31.860	27.233</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 222 4305</p>
<p>($ = 5.6694 Yugoslav dinars)</p>
